    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a millennium of stagnation, Humanity fled to the stars in a bid to leave their past behind, but they're about to learn that tradition is what you make of it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This holiday season, a metallic hoof reaches down from the depths of space, and good tidings it brings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge distractions! Launch gifts! Keep moving! Out of time? Onto the next planet!! It's a bit of a laugh really, but that won't stop you taking it deadly seriously, right? Do a good enough job and you'll have earned a little treat tonight...maybe a <i>real</i> test of your marksmanship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406730/extras/026e014ab6788e7164134cb4bf412192.avif?t=1735714289\" width=800 height=154 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Tiny planets to Christmas your way through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Hidden locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redeem your coins at the Christmas Shop! Spruce up your apartment menu!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in small talk with the cashier!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three endings to discover</p></li></ul>",
